  <item>
    <title>45南疆！南疆！我爱新疆！（很全很细的自驾南疆游览大攻略）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af14c095b7c4709bfe33b1b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af14c095b7c4709bfe33b1b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期提要｜我对新疆的喜爱程度已经到了“新疆是我精神第二故乡”、“七天新疆游，一生新疆情”、“要不我去新疆旅居吧”的程度。这一次，我从北疆启程，南疆结束，看到了湖泊、山川、森林、雪山、冰峰、古城，直到现在码字，仍然意犹未尽。</span></p><p><span>这一期其实迟到有半年了。因为我是五月去的新疆，中途因为各种原因拖更了。从时间上，或许不能对应给下半年去旅行的朋友们，但是除开“应季”这一点，都是非常值得参考的。</span></p><p><span>从租车、路上的注意事项、美景、体验、饮食、文化，到我的旅行全攻略、我的感受、实用的建议和好物的分享，真的很全很详细了！（可以直接抄作业），希望对大家可以有所帮助和启发。也建议大家可以点赞收藏以及转发给亲朋好友们，等要准备去新疆了，再翻出来听一下！</span></p><p><span>⏰时间轴：</span></p><h2><strong><span>自驾经验</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 租车</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> 限速，罚款，摄像头，加油站，边境检查</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtqC2_bw6EW8RUYhkaOmCC1FA3P6.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> 自驾路线</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llgp8_SaYaREDu7Z5pMdWnFzAUzZ.png"><h2><strong><span>一路上的风景：草原——湖泊——雪山——冰川——古城</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a> 北疆</span></p><p><span>库尔德宁、果子沟、赛里木湖</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgub9EAfWIcAyug3e6R5X9jeTLcA.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a> 南疆</span></p><p><span>白沙湖</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkjTAGKPnCmN7UU6oBOijP1f74tR.png"><p><span>慕士塔格峰2号冰川</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvKJ1rXy_qcVGHSlVoL9JR4Vg0QU.png"><p><span>塔合曼湿地</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lp7djlnK7YZFNcP-OzE7zk9cIjrN.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkZ0rsVt1N5kd_nNQ9yLwG_UT6Tp.png"><p><span>喀什古城</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvE6grgAZfDMqTtWE03RD5WOtf0e.png"><h2><strong><span>一路上的美食（甚至回来发现体脂降了，肌肉量上去了）</span></strong></h2><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkffsHDm0A21LRZICcU6ZIvOGwLC.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 喝的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> 硬菜主食</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2218">36:58</a> 水果糕点零食</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2420">40:20</a> 新疆养生产品</span></p><h2><strong><span>除了景点之外可以逛的</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2723">45:23</a> 本地超市</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2900">48:20</a> 牛羊大巴扎</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkEts6nUb5nffGNfXy8qjwR54c83.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiJbbC3pzch7cowJXE6RjDjobxXd.png"><h2><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3026">50:26</a></span></strong><strong><span> 古尔邦节</span></strong></h2><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3197">53:17</a></span></strong><strong><span> 必备好物</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo790TyVX3YtYE_7qEX2Xzx_GyV-.png"><p><strong><span>旅行芳疗必备急救好油</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3343">55:43</a> 皮肤干裂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3430">57:10</a> 长途颠簸/晕车</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3562">59:22</a> 时差、极端气候</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3623">1:00:23</a> 胀气</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3725">1:02:05</a> 防蚊虫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3789">1:03:09</a> 高原反应</span></p><p></p><p><span>制作人：Echi</span></p><p><span>PS：照片来自于自己拍摄，收录于自制的电子手帐。</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
