  <item>
    <title>42波折的春季护理（皮炎复发、玫瑰痤疮、脚部真菌、过敏性鼻炎……）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69eb62561e94ae692111ea46</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69eb62561e94ae692111ea46</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 12:42:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期提要｜命途多舛的3个月……这期间我一直在拿自己做试验，自从换季以来我真的遇上了好多好多问题，经过了了解、尝试、总结，总算可以和大家分享一下这段时间的经验了。春季真的是个很容易诱发皮肤问题的季节，希望大家快乐享受春天的同时，也不要忘记呵护自己！笔芯笔芯！</span></p><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> </span><strong><span>治好？治不好？</span></strong></p><h2><strong><span>皮炎复发</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>复发原因</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 缓解方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">06:05</a> 给偷懒的朋友们安利一款自己在用的产品：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkuOdp7Z-6-vos2Qb7QMAdYK4uBv.png"><h2><strong><span>玫瑰痤疮</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">07:19</a> 玫瑰痤疮是什么？有什么表现形式？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="593">09:53</a> 玫瑰痤疮的诱因</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 我的就医经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> “以前没遇到过，那为什么偏偏是现在爆发了？”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1166">19:26</a> 轻度玫瑰痤疮的治疗核心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 三本相关的书籍</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjL60Y_wy1eHAF1mZ0hCK-70izpv.png"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a> 玫瑰痤疮患者的饮食管理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 玫瑰痤疮的一年四季养护重点</span></p><h2><strong><span>脚部真菌</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">37:17</a> 脚气是怎么来的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2366">39:26</a> 该如何使用芳疗来预防</span></p><h2><strong><span>过敏性鼻炎</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 过敏性鼻炎是什么，一般怎么治疗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2568">42:48</a> 芳香疗法如何辅助？</span></p><p></p><p><span>制作人：Echi</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
