  <item>
    <title>41护肤知识又增长了！成分党、护肤小白和高效率护肤爱好者必听！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696a0570109824f9e1d414d8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696a0570109824f9e1d414d8</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 16 Jan 2026 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期提要｜今天想和大家分享一本我之前提过的护肤书——叶剑清的《美如初见：护肤的真相》。作者叶剑清既是高校里教授化妆品课程的老师，也为多家知名企业提供过咨询，因此他既能深入讲解科学原理，也熟知行业的实际情况与营销策略。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我觉得这本书涵盖的护肤内容非常全面，从洁面、保湿、防晒到美白、祛痘，都讲得很透彻。它的视角是扎实的科学派，虽然我发现其中有一点点的观点与芳疗理念略有不同，引发了我的思考、求教、讨论与试验，但其实这更多是视角之别，让我从中感受到，对待既有所谓“好”成分又有所谓“不好成分”的复杂的天然物，我们在了解之后，最重要的是“如何正确应用”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>护肤最终还是要通过亲身尝试，找到适合自己的方式，而这本书里的很多信息，可以快速帮助到你。它用通俗的语言手把手教你读懂成分表，让你逐步建立自己的判断力，不再轻易被广告或概念左右。如果你希望更理性地护肤，把选择的主动权握在自己手里，那么今天这期播客，不妨一听。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>✨PART 1 成分党的秘诀</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 识破“1%”的秘密分界线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> 掌握“5%”的黄金估算法则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">05:07</a> 别掉进“植物提取物”的华丽陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">06:27</a> 了解你自己的“底子”——肤质分类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">07:52</a> 最重要的心态：“50%假说”</span></p><span></span><h2><span>✨PART 2 谈防腐剂</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a> 防腐剂对皮肤有坏处吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> 认识不同的防腐剂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> 揭秘“无防腐剂”的真相</span></p><span></span><h2><span>✨PART 3 清洁</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> 认识洗面奶里的“狠角色”和“老好人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">21:33</a>用洗面奶洗脸要注意什么</span></p><span></span><h2><span>✨PART 4 卸妆</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> 卸妆产品，到底谁最强？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1506">25:06</a> 卸妆乳、卸妆霜、卸妆水、洗面奶用起来如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1679">27:59</a> 卸妆油是怎么工作的？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>✨PART 5 保湿</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1777">29:37</a> 长效保湿的秘诀：为何补油是关键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1954">32:34</a> 便宜又好用的甘油</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2079">34:39</a> 丙二醇：不安全？咱不背这锅哈！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2213">36:53</a> 保湿界的“超级明星”——玻尿酸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2429">40:29</a> 这配方补水吗？来来来！举个栗子！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2589">43:09</a> 这么多油，到底哪种最好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3212">53:32</a> 橄榄油椰子油到底是好油还是坏油？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4050">1:07:30</a> 我到底该怎么选保湿产品？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>✨PART 6 防晒</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4176">1:09:36</a> 阳光导致的光老化，是皮肤衰老最重要的外部原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4287">1:11:27</a> SPF和PA到底是什么意思呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4551">1:15:51</a> 物理防晒or化学防晒？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4676">1:17:56</a> 大家平时最常遇到的几个防晒上的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4798">1:19:58</a> 真正的防晒，应该遵循一个重要性排序，那就是A、B、C</span></p><span></span><h2><span>✨PART 7 美白</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4934">1:22:14</a> 我们黄种人追求的“白”，到底是一种什么样的白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5003">1:23:23</a> 美白产品到底有没有用？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5107">1:25:07</a> 认识美白成分和他们的原理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5510">1:31:50</a> 破除迷思——吃酱油会变黑吗？美白针到底能不能打？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5627">1:33:47</a> 熊果苷和烟酰胺，到底哪个效果更好？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>✨PART 8 祛痘</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5707">1:35:07</a> 这痘痘到底是咋来的呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5753">1:35:53</a> 对症下药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5928">1:38:48</a> 维A酸祛痘哪家强？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5990">1:39:50</a> 短小低少保平安</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6066">1:41:06</a> 果酸虽好别乱刷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6131">1:42:11</a> 关于黑头白头的深度解析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6373">1:46:13</a> 痘痘长在哪，代表身体哪里有问题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6504">1:48:24</a>毛孔粗大、痘印痘疤痘坑</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作人：Echi</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/667ae5d96db681a9bd78be4a/lsReCEfTeCv9aJ8lcnvieQYLVi3I.m4a" length="110722859" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:54:06</itunes:duration>
