  <item>
    <title>31我们需要更加了解更年期一些。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68198a1247ebeede7ef93df5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68198a1247ebeede7ef93df5</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 May 2025 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期提要｜这一期选择在5.11号母亲节前更新，是我想到，一个女性，她可以选择当母亲或者不当母亲，但是当年岁上涨，女性都会面临更年期这个问题，这个是女性难以选择的，必须面对的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不应该有月经羞耻，也不应该有更年期羞耻，这个话题非常中性，我们都需要更加客观地、科学地了解自己，关爱自己，以及我们身边的女性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 更年期到底是什么？对女性有些什么影响？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 前围绝经期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> 围绝经期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">10:02</a> 绝经期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a> 绝经后期</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 关注情绪健康：女性离焦虑症、抑郁症更近</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> 日常养护，从哪做起？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> 吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a> 动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">19:34</a> 睡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 静心</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmAImbDo0gA-CelH9_Kzi_Pp14ra.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> 定期妇科的检查</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a> 芳疗如何帮助更年期女性？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1417">23:37</a> 经前期综合征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a> 更年期症候群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1581">26:21</a>退行性关节</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><p><span>BGM：Something Worth Saving (爱依然存在) - 孟佳</span></p>]]></description>
